<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">Bank Account Management</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            Comprehensive bank account administration supporting multi-bank operations, automated 
            reconciliation, and real-time cash position visibility across all accounts and currencies.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Account Configuration</h2>
        <p>
            Bank account records capture account numbers, currency denominations, branch details, 
            and authorized signatory information. Multiple accounts per bank and multiple currencies 
            per organization accommodate complex treasury structures.
        </p>
        <p>
            Account classification distinguishes operating accounts from reserve, escrow, and 
            special purpose accounts. Interest rate tracking supports investment account management 
            and interest income recognition.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Statement Integration</h2>
        <p>
            Electronic statement import in standard formats automates transaction capture and 
            reconciliation initiation. File import accommodates various bank formats while 
            maintaining consistent internal processing.
        </p>
        <p>
            Statement line categorization learns from historical matching, improving automation 
            rates over time. Unmatched items queue for manual classification with pattern 
            recognition suggestions accelerating processing.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Reconciliation Processing</h2>
        <p>
            Automated matching pairs statement transactions with general ledger entries based 
            on amount, date proximity, and reference information. High-confidence matches clear 
            automatically while exceptions require operator review.
        </p>
        <p>
            Outstanding item tracking maintains lists of uncleared deposits and payments, with 
            aging analysis identifying stale items requiring investigation. Cut-off management 
            ensures period-end reconciliations capture all relevant transactions.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Cash Position Management</h2>
        <p>
            Consolidated cash reporting aggregates balances across all accounts and currencies, 
            presenting organizational liquidity in functional currency equivalent. Position 
            dashboards update in real time as transactions post.
        </p>
        <p>
            Forecasting integrates scheduled payments, expected receipts, and recurring transactions 
            to project future cash positions. Alert thresholds notify treasury personnel when 
            balances approach minimum operating levels or credit facility triggers.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

